<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Spam F2 button for non targeting skill.
This macro not works if you put Targeted Skill or Area Skill.
For example you can use this macro to Grand Cross Skill in Paladin Job, Howling of Chulhoo and Hogogong Strike in Sprit Handler Skill.
Note:
Put your desired skill in F2 Shortcut.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 59 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 59 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Ragnarok</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>